design.text:
`lune run z-nile/affected -- <the touched paths above, without the acceptance folder>` lists most of the tooling suite (`main.luau` is read by most tooling specs). These exercise statuses, the board, the dispatcher's stop and retry, and z-work:
- tooling: `z-nile/tests/tooling/work.spec.luau`, `readycheck.spec.luau`, `dispatch-texts.spec.luau`, `dispatch-guards.spec.luau`, `board.spec.luau`, `board-review.spec.luau`, `approve.spec.luau`;
- promoted: `z-nile/tests/acceptance/c0053/status.spec.luau`, `c0117/control-cli.spec.luau`, `c0117/dispatch.spec.luau`, `c0117/docs.spec.luau`, `c0118/view.spec.luau`, `c0118/model.spec.luau`, `c0118/page.spec.luau`, `c0068/stop.spec.luau`, `c0259/readme.spec.luau`, and c0256's folder once it is promoted;
- tooling, for `audit`, `raftplan` and `publish`: `z-nile/tests/tooling/audit-raft-roots.spec.luau`, `audit-spec-left.spec.luau`, `approve-publish.spec.luau`, `raftcheck.spec.luau`, `recombine-members.spec.luau`, and the promoted `c0081/publish-guard.spec.luau`;
- promoted, f0399: `z-nile/tests/acceptance/f0399/pick.spec.luau` (builds `RaftFact.questions`, which stays) and `f0399/docs.spec.luau` (the Headless sections; on the Overrides line);
- new: `z-nile/.tracker/issues/c0250/acceptance/escalation.spec.luau`, `status.spec.luau`, `block-resolve.spec.luau`, `dispatch-block.spec.luau`, `work-board.spec.luau`, `docs.spec.luau`, `publish.spec.luau` and `audit.spec.luau`.
The full list is the selector's output at execution. Implementation step 13 runs the whole suite and the slow tier.
